# ZubLock ship vs lab

The zip/installer friends download is frozen at the working AWS TCP 443 lock. Do not change it until the user explicitly says to **ship ZubLock**.

## Frozen (do not touch until ship)

- `%LOCALAPPDATA%\ZubLock` — the working desktop app
- `zublock/` and `installer/ZubLock.iss` in git — pushing those rebuilds `zublock-latest`

Do not edit, copy-over, commit, or push those paths for trial-and-error.

## Experiments

- `%LOCALAPPDATA%\ZubLockLab` — local Lab copy + **ZubLock Lab** desktop shortcut
- Change only files under ZubLockLab
- Do not merge Lab experiments into `zublock/` or the frozen install unless the user says the Lab version is good **and** to ship the zip

## When the user says ship ZubLock

1. Copy the proven Lab files into repo `zublock/` (and Inno if needed).
2. Then follow the normal experimental / push-to-both release workflow so CI refreshes `zublock-latest`.
